### GET /api/v1/games/get/artworks

This endpoint retrieves artwork details for the specified game IDs.

#### Request

- Method: GET

- URL: `http://localhost:3000/api/v1/games/get/artworks`

- Query Parameters:

    - ids (required, array of integers): The IDs of the games for which artwork details are requested.


#### Response

The response for this request can be represented as a JSON schema:

``` json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "success": {
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "queryResult": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "game": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "height": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "image_id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "url": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "width": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "checksum": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}

 ```

