### Apply Promo Code

This endpoint allows the client to apply a promo code to the order total.

#### Request Body

- `code` (string) - The promo code to be applied.

- `orderTotal` (number) - The total amount of the order.


#### Response

The response is a JSON object with the following properties:

- `valid` (boolean) - Indicates whether the promo code is valid.

- `discount` (number) - The amount of discount applied.

- `newTotal` (number) - The new total amount after applying the promo code.

- `promoCode` (string) - The promo code that was applied.

- `status` (boolean) - Indicates the status of the promo code application.


#### JSON Schema

``` json
{
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
        "valid": {
            "type": "boolean"
        },
        "discount": {
            "type": "number"
        },
        "newTotal": {
            "type": "number"
        },
        "promoCode": {
            "type": "string"
        },
        "status": {
            "type": "boolean"
        }
    }
}

 ```

